    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/8ed6c58669fa8e78cd2ae634e2b6bf89.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/c76cdc9b907816f38d0c70096a0b4bfe.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lhama Clicker</strong> is an idle clicker game about <strong>reproducing</strong> an <strong>infinite</strong> number of llamas. To increase your production to <strong>ridiculous levels</strong>, you will need to buy upgrades, level up, buy <strong>astral upgrades</strong>, and <strong>rebirth</strong> many times to become <strong>faster and more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along this adventure, you will <strong>also</strong> unlock cosmetics such as llama skins, beautiful hats, and new backgrounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/8c2f6ef2578f9f13734047a6379992d2.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/48a36a7a12b5bcd7a63a3b6b3581a743.poster.avif?t=1748869224\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/48a36a7a12b5bcd7a63a3b6b3581a743.webm?t=1748869224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/48a36a7a12b5bcd7a63a3b6b3581a743.mp4?t=1748869224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/73f210015c834430e43d43338ee0deee.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/f16713b635aa0cfeba8fd37a21a6a1fe.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/d4f367c4d2879460c063d2c436eb4f41.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/761214070222d5efa49cc136cb5fd8bc.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/badaddce0c6443bb5dc1989320edee69.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/2b1774ca634647d6d9d889e4f87f80f7.poster.avif?t=1748869224\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/2b1774ca634647d6d9d889e4f87f80f7.webm?t=1748869224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/2b1774ca634647d6d9d889e4f87f80f7.mp4?t=1748869224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/0d87268ec569dae5ac99363025793063.avif?t=1748869224\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36+ Upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ Backgrounds </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38+ Skins </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31+ Hats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Skill Tree</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>